			<tr><td class="comment">サイズを自在に調整できるのは3D造形の強みですね。</td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/onitama003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/onitama003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/etc/SO-TA/onitamaoyamori/img/onitama003.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
